  "scientific_caveats": [
    "Dendrocystites barrandei uses smooth small-to-medium Letna morphology in Noailles2014; one unbranched short brachiole, distinct long homoiostele and small suranal plate. Do not import hyperadult D.sedgwicki rosettes. Living thickness, full tips and exact plate/segment counts are artistic. Fossil photographs are labelled latex casts, not living anatomy.",
    "Trochocystites NMP.L9060 is an actual fossil photo in Lefebvre2024 Fig1A, not Rahman2020 digital reconstructions. Its homostele is absent; complete short homostele is primary-text extrapolation.2009 and2024 lectotype accession discrepancy remains unresolved. Interior pavement is a deliberately coarse low-poly sampling, not a plate-for-plate fossil replica.",
    "Helicoplacus actual downloaded and inspected primary paper is Sprinkle & Wilbur2005, although the retained downloaded filename says2006. Wilbur2006 synonymy is supported by its primary abstract only; full2006 text unavailable. LACMNH17529 cast was captioned H.everndeni and used under revised H.gilberti. Three lateral-mouth ambulacra and left-handed plate geometry, not Helicocystis. Anal position unresolved and not invented.",
    "Stromatocystites pentangularis is a fully plated low subpentagonal disc with five narrow surface ambulacra and broad interambulacra, not projecting arms. Smith1985 text and actual casts support it;2015 primary abstract terminology/synonymy only, full text not claimed read. The aboral pad, living thickness and plate sampling are stylized.",
    "All numeric dimensions are nominal artistic choices, not scientific hard bounds. Actual transformed dimensions are reported separately. Strict contact and finite whole-scene exposure samples do not by themselves establish pixel readability or independent acceptance.",
    "Final generator revision r007 is an implementation revision shared by four delivery r001 subjects. Two earlier derived binding attempts were retired before final evidence; exact source/GLB hashes, not directory revision label alone, identify current final subjects."
  ],
  "fresh_qa_focus": [
    "Inspect original primary text and original fossil/cast pixels locally, distinguishing casts, fossils and later digital reconstruction.",
    "Personally inspect32 distinct exact-final512frames,4 lossless sheets and4 exact details. All were maker-viewed, but this is not independent QA.",
    "Check single D brachiole versus long homoiostele; T rightmouth and unequal grooves/shortstele; H three lateral-mouth paths/left-handed plating; S five narrow surface bands on a continuous lowdisc.",
    "Check exact original final GLB topology, full-source dimensions/contact/exposure, original-source reopen and two real separately executed Blender PIDs per subject.",
    "Reference access limits and nominal dimensions are explicit; do not turn planning prose or artistic sampling into scientific authority."
  ],
